  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "From the main tent, Hei Lou Lan snorts and sends blue butterfly elite troop, five hundred strong, to cut past the rank four battle rings toward Hua tribe’s hundred blossoms division. That troop is weak at attacking and defending and specialized at healing; it has just healed large groups of wounded and steadied Dong Fang’s base-level Gu Masters. The charge looks about to succeed when three elite troops hit from east, south, and west. Dong Fang Yu Liang had already set hundred blossoms as bait with those three lying in ambush, then refuses Dong Fang She’s urge to crush the line himself while the situation stays inside his plan.",
